# AI SECRET SHOPPER

## Customer Conversion + Trust Audit

Use this prompt to audit a website through the eyes of a realistic prospective customer.

It is designed to work across different industries, including:

* Local service businesses
* Trades
* Professional services
* Ecommerce
* B2B
* Software
* Healthcare
* Legal
* Automotive
* Property
* High-value purchases
* Hospitality
* Retail
* And most other customer-facing businesses

The audit should answer one central question:

> **Would this particular customer feel confident enough to contact, book, buy from or choose this company?**

