# AUDIT OBJECTIVE

Act as the customer described above.

Do not perform a generic SEO audit.

Do not perform a generic web-design critique.

Do not review the website from the perspective of an industry expert unless the persona is genuinely an industry expert.

Instead determine:

> **What would THIS customer need to see, understand and believe before choosing THIS company for THIS particular need?**

Review the website from that perspective.

