# EXECUTIVE SUMMARY PRESENTATION RULES

The presentation must:

* Be understandable without the detailed report
* Avoid walls of text
* Avoid unnecessary URLs
* Avoid repeated findings
* Use customer language
* Prioritise commercial significance
* Contain no more than 10 presentation sections
* Contain no more than 3 priority recommendations
* Be suitable for screen-sharing
* Make the important findings obvious within seconds
* Use whitespace generously
* Avoid shrinking text to fit too much onto a slide

Where actual presentation file creation is available, create a polished presentation rather than simply formatting text to resemble slides.

