# APPENDIX — EVIDENCE

Where there is substantial supporting evidence, put lower-priority material in an appendix rather than cluttering the main report.

Possible appendix content:

* Additional quotations
* Supporting URLs
* Additional page observations
* Lower-priority issues
* Secondary trust signals
* Supporting screenshots where available

The appendix exists so:

> **The main report remains readable without losing the evidence behind it.**

